        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Teal badge: primary flow step&lt;br&gt;Solid arrow: synchronous request&lt;br&gt;Dashed arrow: asynchronous message or replication (labelled)&lt;br&gt;Edge label starting cross-AZ, cross-Region, hybrid or egress: cost-bearing path&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Boundaries are draw.io's AWS group styles:&lt;br&gt;Pink frame, account icon: AWS account (ownership scope, not a network)&lt;br&gt;Teal dashed frame, flag: AWS Region&lt;br&gt;Purple frame, VPC icon: VPC&lt;br&gt;Blue dashed frame: Availability Zone&lt;br&gt;Green fill, padlock: public subnet&lt;br&gt;Teal fill, padlock: private subnet&lt;br&gt;Grey dashed frame: auxiliary services (decorative)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#545B64;fontColor=#232F3E;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
